							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Enough of Tyranny.  An end to Fear.  For one night, we take back the streets many of us once called home.  Saturday, November 11, 7:00 PM EST, all Paladins, of all allegiances, of all skills will rally at the Hall of Truth in North Freeport.  From there, we will strategically assault the corrupt stronghold of the Freeport Militia.  It will be a day of righteous wrath and celebration!  
An end to Injustice!  Purify your hearts!  There is no greater cause!

(Strategy to be discussed on the Paladin Boards at www.solusekro.org.)
Ps...  This is about pageantry, about fun, about being Paladins!  (Pretend Paladins are welcome too!  *wink*)  
							<br>
